ng and review completion are not recorded, and outcomes were not observed. Its approval is limited to that exercise, not a standing policy change.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"k:rp-tie-calibration-approval@1.0:99b5da48\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"claim:c9\", \"kind\": \"CLAIM_SOURCE_FACT\", \"text\": \"The batch announcement asks for affected task references for model/task connection drops; it does not address the criterion for a preference.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"k:slack:C_RP_ANNOUNCEMENTS:1790883558.000028:d0ddced2\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"summary:s1\", \"kind\": \"SUMMARY\", \"text\": \"A tutor asks whether slightly clearer wording justifies preferring B on RP-4354; a QA tutor asks whether cleanliness versus detail warrants a slight preference.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790904354.000049\", \"m:C_RP_QA:1790940523.000045\"], \"attributions\": [{\"user_id\": \"U013\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790904354.000049\", \"role\": \"TUTOR\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U008\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_RP_QA:1790940523.000045\", \"role\": \"QA_TUTOR\"}]}, {\"statement_id\": \"summary:s2\", \"kind\": \"SUMMARY\", \"text\": \"Current guidance requires meaningful user benefit, but the RP-4354 thread has not yet received a handling answer.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790904354.000049\", \"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790904409.000113\", \"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790904449.000226\", \"k:response-preference-instructions@1.1:176ce67d\"], \"attributions\": [{\"user_id\": \"U013\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790904354.000049\", \"role\": \"TUTOR\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U010\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790904409.000113\", \"role\": \"TUTOR\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U014\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790904449.000226\", \"role\": \"QA_TUTOR\"}]}, {\"statement_id\": \"detail:d1\", \"kind\": \"DETAIL\", \"text\": \"In an earlier thread, the same QA tutor reports that both responses are acceptable but B sounds clearer.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790859242.000048\"], \"attributions\": [{\"user_id\": \"U008\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790859242.000048\", \"role\": \"QA_TUTOR\"}], \"depends_on\": [\"summary:s1\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"detail:d2\", \"kind\": \"DETAIL\", \"text\": \"The team lead instructed the QA tutor in both threads to specify which response materially helps the user more; neither thread contains the requested explanation.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790859242.000048\", \"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790859337.000226\", \"m:C_RP_QA:1790940523.000045\", \"m:C_RP_QA:1790940616.000226\"], \"attributions\": [{\"user_id\": \"U008\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790859242.000048\", \"role\": \"QA_TUTOR\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U001\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790859337.000226\", \"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U008\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_RP_QA:1790940523.000045\", \"role\": \"QA_TUTOR\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U001\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_RP_QA:1790940616.000226\", \"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\"}]}, {\"statement_id\": \"detail:d3\", \"kind\": \"DETAIL\", \"text\": \"In the RP-4354 thread, a tutor reports that A answers fully and B adds nothing substantive, while a QA tutor asks what meaningful user-facing benefit would justify a preference.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790904354.000049\", \"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790904409.000113\", \"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790904449.000226\"], \"attributions\": [{\"user_id\": \"U013\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790904354.000049\", \"role\": \"TUTOR\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U010\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790904409.000113\", \"role\": \"TUTOR\"}, {\"user_id\": \"U014\", \"relation\": \"AUTHOR\", \"evidence_id\": \"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790904449.000226\", \"role\": \"QA_TUTOR\"}]}, {\"statement_id\": \"detail:d4\", \"kind\": \"DETAIL\", \"text\": \"An earlier batch-14 approval records a similar concern about unexplained clarity preferences, but posting and the review exercise were still pending and their outcomes were not observed.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"k:rp-tie-calibration-approval@1.0:99b5da48\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"action\", \"kind\": \"ACTION\", \"text\": \"Post a reminder. Instruction: Reply in the RP-4354 thread with the current tie rule and ask for the user-facing benefit behind any preference. Draft to copy: For RP-4354, slightly clearer wording alone is not enough to establish a preference. Under the current instructions, choose a tie when neither response has a meaningful quality advantage; cosmetic phrasing alone does not justify a preference. If you select B on a small difference, explain the user-facing benefit. Please identify what the clearer wording improves for the user's request, rather than relying on clarity as a label. Scope: This reply explains the criterion for RP-4354; it does not decide which response has a meaningful advantage.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790904354.000049\", \"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790904409.000113\", \"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790904449.000226\", \"k:response-preference-instructions@1.1:176ce67d\"], \"premises\": [{\"statement_id\": \"claim:c2\", \"status\": \"PENDING_YOUR_VERDICT\"}, {\"statement_id\": \"claim:c4\", \"status\": \"PENDING_YOUR_VERDICT\"}, {\"statement_id\": \"claim:c7\", \"status\": \"PENDING_YOUR_VERDICT\"}]}, {\"statement_id\": \"action:rationale\", \"kind\": \"ACTION_RATIONALE\", \"text\": \"Why this helps: The current instructions directly answer the criterion question. A focused reply supplies that rule without treating the other threads' instructions as project-wide guidance or deciding the label without a stated benefit.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790904354.000049\", \"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790904409.000113\", \"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790904449.000226\", \"k:response-preference-instructions@1.1:176ce67d\", \"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790859242.000048\", \"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790859337.000226\", \"m:C_RP_QA:1790940523.000045\", \"m:C_RP_QA:1790940616.000226\", \"k:rp-tie-calibration-approval@1.0:99b5da48\", \"k:slack:C_RP_ANNOUNCEMENTS:1790883558.000028:d0ddced2\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"action:need\", \"kind\": \"INTERVENTION_NEED\", \"text\": \"Why intervening now is needed (an unresolved handling question): The tutor's RP-4354 question remains unanswered after replies assessing the responses and asking for a user-facing benefit.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790904354.000049\", \"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790904409.000113\", \"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790904449.000226\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"resolution:member_a6c0032f49d046f8e80dd119\", \"kind\": \"RESOLUTION\", \"text\": \"Member thread member_a6c0032f49d046f8e80dd119 is PARTIALLY_RESOLVED: The team lead supplies a thread-scoped criterion, but the QA tutor has not supplied the requested material user benefit or a final comparison.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790859242.000048\", \"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790859300.000113\", \"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790859337.000226\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"resolution:member_b7f9b6276cc5d77211bb73c7\", \"kind\": \"RESOLUTION\", \"text\": \"Member thread member_b7f9b6276cc5d77211bb73c7 is UNRESOLVED: The tutor's question receives another tutor's assessment and a QA tutor's question, but no handling answer or final label.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790904354.000049\", \"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790904409.000113\", \"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790904449.000226\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"resolution:member_5a0db8eea777cc90029866c4\", \"kind\": \"RESOLUTION\", \"text\": \"Member thread member_5a0db8eea777cc90029866c4 is PARTIALLY_RESOLVED: The team lead explains the criterion within the thread, but the QA tutor has not provided the requested user-benefit explanation or a final comparison.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_RP_QA:1790940523.000045\", \"m:C_RP_QA:1790940571.000113\", \"m:C_RP_QA:1790940616.000226\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"severity:rationale\", \"kind\": \"SEVERITY_RATIONALE\", \"text\": \"Severity MEDIUM: A tutor and a QA tutor raise comparable uncertainty about the tie-versus-preference criterion across three threads. This can change labels, but the messages do not establish broad disruption or incorrect submissions.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790859242.000048\", \"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790904354.000049\", \"m:C_RP_QA:1790940523.000045\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"severity:signal:MEDIUM[0]\", \"kind\": \"SEVERITY_SIGNAL\", \"text\": \"Rubric signal met - \\\"Recurring confusion about the same rule, tool behavior, or scoring criterion that suggests meaningful workflow or labeling impact\\\": A tutor asks whether slightly clearer wording warrants choosing B, while a QA tutor raises clarity and cleanliness-versus-detail comparisons in two threads; these concern whether to assign a preference rather than a tie.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790859242.000048\", \"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790904354.000049\", \"m:C_RP_QA:1790940523.000045\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"severity:recurrence\", \"kind\": \"HISTORICAL_RECURRENCE\", \"text\": \"Retrieved records show this problem occurred before.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"k:rp-tie-calibration-approval@1.0:99b5da48\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"reporter:U013\", \"kind\": \"AFFECTED_REPORTER\", \"text\": \"U013 reports, in their own cited message, being affected by this problem.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790904354.000049\"]}, {\"statement_id\": \"reporter:U008\", \"kind\": \"AFFECTED_REPORTER\", \"text\": \"U008 reports, in their own cited message, being affected by this problem.\", \"evidence_ids\": [\"m:C_RP_QA:1790940523.000045\"]}], \"member_threads\": [{\"evidence_id\": \"m:C_RP_GENERAL:1790859242.000048\", \"origin\": \"member_message\", \"use\": \"MEMBER_REPORT\", \"member_id\": \"member_a6c0032f49d046f8e80dd119\", \"thread_id\": \"1790859242.000048\", \